{"s10_scav_clock_radio_names_044","scavenge",2,"reg=family,civilian|day=5,120|mood=sad",{1,"I once found a clock radio in a boy's room. Batteries still in the back",2,"Anything but hiss?",1,"A man reading names. Said they were people who'd made it to his place",2,"I'd have listened for ours too. Doesn't tell us who's broadcasting now"}},
